{"text": "At that moment, someone knocked at the door, and an old man named Geppetto came in. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was a poor man who lived alone in a tiny room. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The boys of the neighborhood called him Polendina because his yellow wig looked like corn pudding. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Geppetto hated this name, and he became very angry whenever he heard it. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I want to make a wonderful wooden puppet that can dance and jump, he said. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With this puppet, I will travel around the world and earn my bread. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Just then the tiny voice in the log shouted, Good idea, Polendina. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Geppetto thought that Master Cherry had said it, so the two old men started to fight. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> After the fight, they shook hands and promised to be good friends again. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But when Master Cherry handed him the log, it jumped and hit Geppetto hard on the leg. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> They argued again, but at last Geppetto took the log under his arm and limped home.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", "t", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "m", "o", "m", "e", "n", "t", ",", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "o", "n", "e", " ", "k", "n", "o", "c", "k", "e", "d", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "d", "o", "o", "r", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", "d", " ", "G", "e", "p", "p", "e", "t", "t", "o", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "i", "n", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "s", " ", "a", " ", "p", "o", "o", "r", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "w", "h", "o", " ", "l", "i", "v", "e", "d", " ", "a", "l", "o", "n", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "a", " ", "t", "i", "n", "y", " ", "r", "o", "o", "m", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"",